  "name": "To Strife: Praise Nikador",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/To_Strife:_Praise_Nikador",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-24T09:17:20.884Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Before a campaign, Kremnoan citizens will organize a blood ritual, igniting Nikador's might with slaughter, singing hymns over the wails of the sacrificial tribute."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e16ce3e8cefaa6f0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Undefeated, Overlord of Battlefields, King of Castrum Kremnos and the Ruins,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Grand Artisan of Chariots, the Throne of Corpses, Father of Victory,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The tyrant of glories, lightning that shatters earth and seas, Guardian of Amphoreus,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Strife Titan, Lance of Fury, Nikador."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0a60f2a917659aa4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Commander to whom the world should bow, the eternally edged weapon, the law of Strife and that which severs strife."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Praise Nikador, the greatest conqueror, the greatest protector."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You are the tyrant of all defeated, solely bearing all wounds of the world on your back."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b2ae194f0318ed98"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You were once the lightning spear of the firmament, the worldsplitting spine."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hewing of the River of Souls, survivors unto dead waters."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Unceasing flames of war, pyre of high graves."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sky-piercing lance, the ruination of night and light."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6b4c40061e858b34"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The vanquished behold woe, glory to all honorable dead, the fallen feeds my might."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fury falls, and all bows to Strife —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sentinels who stand fast between the skies and earth, repel the enemy hordes and safeguard the peace of the myriad cities!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Calamity eternal casting devastation on myriad cities, turning foes to ash!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-847eb9688f377dc4"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
